@startuml 使用案例4_1: 醫療紀錄新增
title 使用案例4.1: 醫療紀錄新增

actor "動物管理者" as User
participant "MedicalRecords.vue" as MedicalRecordsPage
participant "medicalRecords.ts" as MedicalRecordsAPI
participant "medical_records.py(blueprint)" as MedicalRecordsBlueprint
participant "medical_record_service.py" as MedicalRecordService
participant "medical_record.py(model)" as MedicalRecordModel
participant "animal.py(model)" as AnimalModel
participant "user.py(model)" as UserModel
participant "others.py(Attachment)(model)" as AttachmentModel
database "MySQL" as DB

note over User, DB
  **前置條件:**
  使用者已登入系統
  使用者角色為動物擁有者、收容所會員或管理員
  使用者具有動物管理權限
end note

== 1. 進入醫療記錄管理頁面 ==
User -> MedicalRecordsPage: 訪問 /medical-records
activate MedicalRecordsPage
MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsPage: onMounted()\\n初始化頁面
MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsAPI: getAnimalsForMedicalRecords()
activate MedicalRecordsAPI
note right
  載入使用者有權限管理的動物列表:
  - 管理員: 所有動物
  - 收容所會員: 所屬收容所動物 + 個人動物
  - 一般會員: 個人動物
end note
MedicalRecordsAPI -> MedicalRecordsBlueprint: GET /medical-records/animals
activate MedicalRecordsBlueprint

MedicalRecordsBlueprint -> MedicalRecordsBlueprint: @jwt_required()\\n取得 current_user_id
MedicalRecordsBlueprint -> UserModel: User.query.get(current_user_id)
activate UserModel
UserModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE user_id=?
activate DB
DB --> UserModel: 使用者資料
deactivate DB
UserModel --> MedicalRecordsBlueprint: User 物件
deactivate UserModel

MedicalRecordsBlueprint -> MedicalRecordService: list_animals_for_medical_records(user, filters)
activate MedicalRecordService

MedicalRecordService -> MedicalRecordService: 根據角色建立查詢條件
note right
  權限邏輯:
  - ADMIN: 查詢所有動物
  - SHELTER_MEMBER: owner_id=user_id OR shelter_id=primary_shelter_id
  - 一般會員: owner_id=user_id
end note

MedicalRecordService -> AnimalModel: Animal.query.filter(權限條件)
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals\\nWHERE deleted_at IS NULL\\nAND (權限條件)
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: animals[]
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> MedicalRecordService: Animal 列表
deactivate AnimalModel

MedicalRecordService --> MedicalRecordsBlueprint: {animals[], total}
deactivate MedicalRecordService
MedicalRecordsBlueprint --> MedicalRecordsAPI: 200 OK + {animals[], total}
deactivate MedicalRecordsBlueprint
MedicalRecordsAPI --> MedicalRecordsPage: 動物列表資料
deactivate MedicalRecordsAPI

MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsPage: 渲染動物卡片
MedicalRecordsPage --> User: 顯示可管理的動物列表
deactivate MedicalRecordsPage

== 2. 選擇要新增醫療記錄的動物 ==
User -> MedicalRecordsPage: 點選動物卡片
activate MedicalRecordsPage
MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsPage: selectAnimal(animal)
MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsPage: 開啟動物詳情 Modal
MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsAPI: getMedicalRecords(animal_id)
activate MedicalRecordsAPI
note right
  載入該動物的現有醫療記錄
end note
MedicalRecordsAPI -> MedicalRecordsBlueprint: GET /medical-records/animals/{id}/medical-records
activate MedicalRecordsBlueprint

MedicalRecordsBlueprint -> MedicalRecordModel: MedicalRecord.query.filter_by(animal_id, deleted_at=None)
activate MedicalRecordModel
MedicalRecordModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM medical_records\\nWHERE animal_id=?\\nAND deleted_at IS NULL\\nORDER BY date DESC, created_at DESC
activate DB
DB --> MedicalRecordModel: medical_records[]
deactivate DB
MedicalRecordModel --> MedicalRecordsBlueprint: MedicalRecord 列表
deactivate MedicalRecordModel

MedicalRecordsBlueprint --> MedicalRecordsAPI: 200 OK + {medical_records[], total}
deactivate MedicalRecordsBlueprint
MedicalRecordsAPI --> MedicalRecordsPage: 醫療記錄列表
deactivate MedicalRecordsAPI

MedicalRecordsPage --> User: 顯示動物詳情與現有醫療記錄
deactivate MedicalRecordsPage

== 3. 開啟新增醫療記錄表單 ==
User -> MedicalRecordsPage: 點擊「新增醫療記錄」按鈕
activate MedicalRecordsPage
MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsPage: 檢查管理權限
note right
  檢查使用者是否可為該動物新增記錄:
  - 管理員可新增所有動物記錄
  - 動物擁有者可新增自己動物記錄
  - 收容所會員可新增所屬收容所動物記錄
  
  注意: 管理員可新增但不能編輯醫療記錄
  管理員的角色是驗證記錄而非修改內容
end note

alt 無管理權限
  MedicalRecordsPage --> User: alert('無權限為此動物新增醫療記錄')
  note right: 終止流程
end

MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsPage: openAddModal()
MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsPage: 初始化表單資料
note right
  newRecord = {
    record_type: '',
    date: '',
    provider: '',
    details: '',
    attachments: []
  }
end note
MedicalRecordsPage --> User: 顯示新增記錄表單 Modal
deactivate MedicalRecordsPage

== 4. 填寫醫療記錄資訊 ==
User -> MedicalRecordsPage: 選擇紀錄類型
activate MedicalRecordsPage
MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsPage: newRecord.record_type = type
note right
  紀錄類型選項:
  - TREATMENT (治療)
  - CHECKUP (健康檢查)
  - VACCINE (疫苗)
  - SURGERY (手術)
  - OTHER (其他)
end note
deactivate MedicalRecordsPage

User -> MedicalRecordsPage: 填寫紀錄日期
activate MedicalRecordsPage
MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsPage: newRecord.date = date
note right: 日期格式: YYYY-MM-DD
deactivate MedicalRecordsPage

User -> MedicalRecordsPage: 填寫醫療提供者
activate MedicalRecordsPage
MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsPage: newRecord.provider = provider
note right: 例如: 動物醫院名稱或獸醫師
deactivate MedicalRecordsPage

User -> MedicalRecordsPage: 填寫詳細說明
activate MedicalRecordsPage
MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsPage: newRecord.details = details
note right
  詳細記錄內容:
  - 診斷結果
  - 治療方式
  - 用藥資訊
  - 特殊注意事項
end note
deactivate MedicalRecordsPage

== 5. 上傳醫療證明文件 ==
opt 上傳附件
  User -> MedicalRecordsPage: 選擇檔案上傳
  activate MedicalRecordsPage
  MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsPage: handleFileUpload(files)
  note right
    支援格式:
    - 圖片: JPG, PNG, GIF
    - 文件: PDF
    - 最大 5MB/檔
  end note
  
  loop 每個檔案
    MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsAPI: uploadFile(file)
    activate MedicalRecordsAPI
    note right: 透過預簽名 URL 上傳至 MinIO
    MedicalRecordsAPI --> MedicalRecordsPage: {storage_key, url, filename, mime_type, size}
    deactivate MedicalRecordsAPI
    
    MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsPage: newRecord.attachments.push(attachment_info)
  end
  
  MedicalRecordsPage --> User: 顯示已上傳檔案清單
  deactivate MedicalRecordsPage
end

== 6. 提交醫療記錄 ==
User -> MedicalRecordsPage: 點擊「儲存記錄」按鈕
activate MedicalRecordsPage
MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsPage: validateForm()
note right
  驗證規則:
  - 至少填寫一項資訊
  - 日期不可為未來日期
  - 附件格式與大小符合規定
end note

alt 驗證失敗
  MedicalRecordsPage --> User: alert('請填寫必要資訊')
  note right: 返回步驟 4
end

MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsAPI: createMedicalRecord(animal_id, newRecord)
activate MedicalRecordsAPI
note right
  請求資料:
  {
    record_type: 'VACCINE',
    date: '2025-12-20',
    provider: 'XX動物醫院',
    details: '施打狂犬病疫苗',
    attachments: [{storage_key, url, ...}]
  }
end note
MedicalRecordsAPI -> MedicalRecordsBlueprint: POST /medical-records/animals/{id}/medical-records
activate MedicalRecordsBlueprint

MedicalRecordsBlueprint -> MedicalRecordsBlueprint: @jwt_required()\\n取得 current_user_id
MedicalRecordsBlueprint -> MedicalRecordsBlueprint: 解析請求資料
MedicalRecordsBlueprint -> MedicalRecordsBlueprint: 驗證 record_type enum 值

alt 無效的紀錄類型
  MedicalRecordsBlueprint --> MedicalRecordsAPI: 400 Bad Request\\n無效的紀錄類型
  MedicalRecordsAPI --> MedicalRecordsPage: 錯誤訊息
  MedicalRecordsPage --> User: alert('無效的紀錄類型')
  note right: 終止流程
end

MedicalRecordsBlueprint -> MedicalRecordsBlueprint: 驗證日期格式

MedicalRecordsBlueprint -> MedicalRecordService: create_medical_record(\\nanimal_id, current_user_id,\\nrecord_type, date, provider, details, attachments)
activate MedicalRecordService

== 7. 驗證動物存在 ==
MedicalRecordService -> AnimalModel: Animal.query.filter_by(animal_id, deleted_at=None).first()
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals\\nWHERE animal_id=?\\nAND deleted_at IS NULL
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: animal 資料
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> MedicalRecordService: Animal 物件
deactivate AnimalModel

alt 動物不存在
  MedicalRecordService --> MedicalRecordsBlueprint: NotFoundError('動物不存在')
  MedicalRecordsBlueprint --> MedicalRecordsAPI: 404 Not Found
  MedicalRecordsAPI --> MedicalRecordsPage: 錯誤訊息
  MedicalRecordsPage --> User: alert('動物不存在')
  note right: 終止流程
end

== 8. 檢查使用者權限 ==
MedicalRecordService -> UserModel: User.query.get(current_user_id)
activate UserModel
UserModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE user_id=?
activate DB
DB --> UserModel: user 資料
deactivate DB
UserModel --> MedicalRecordService: User 物件
deactivate UserModel

alt 使用者不存在
  MedicalRecordService --> MedicalRecordsBlueprint: NotFoundError('用戶不存在')
  MedicalRecordsBlueprint --> MedicalRecordsAPI: 404 Not Found
  MedicalRecordsAPI --> MedicalRecordsPage: 錯誤訊息
  MedicalRecordsPage --> User: alert('用戶不存在')
  note right: 終止流程
end

MedicalRecordService -> MedicalRecordService: 檢查權限
note right
  權限檢查邏輯:
  1. user.role == ADMIN  有權限
  2. animal.owner_id == current_user_id  有權限
  3. animal.shelter_id == user.primary_shelter_id\\n   AND user.role == SHELTER_MEMBER  有權限
  否則  無權限
end note

alt 無權限
  MedicalRecordService --> MedicalRecordsBlueprint: PermissionDeniedError('無權限為此動物創建醫療紀錄')
  MedicalRecordsBlueprint --> MedicalRecordsAPI: 403 Forbidden
  MedicalRecordsAPI --> MedicalRecordsPage: 錯誤訊息
  MedicalRecordsPage --> User: alert('無權限為此動物創建醫療紀錄')
  note right: 終止流程
end

== 9. 創建醫療記錄 ==
MedicalRecordService -> MedicalRecordModel: 建立 MedicalRecord 物件
activate MedicalRecordModel
note right
  MedicalRecord(
    animal_id=animal_id,
    record_type=record_type,
    date=date,
    provider=provider,
    details=details,
    attachments=attachments_data,
    verified=False,
    created_by=current_user_id
  )
end note
MedicalRecordModel -> DB: INSERT INTO medical_records\\n(animal_id, record_type, date, provider,\\ndetails, attachments, verified, created_by,\\ncreated_at, updated_at)
activate DB
note right
  初始狀態:
  - verified = False (未驗證)
  - created_by = 建立者 ID
  - created_at = NOW()
end note
DB --> MedicalRecordModel: medical_record_id
deactivate DB
MedicalRecordModel --> MedicalRecordService: MedicalRecord 物件
deactivate MedicalRecordModel

MedicalRecordService -> MedicalRecordService: db.session.flush()\\n取得 medical_record_id

== 10. 處理附件記錄 ==
opt 有上傳附件
  loop 每個附件
    MedicalRecordService -> AttachmentModel: 建立 Attachment 物件
    activate AttachmentModel
    note right
      Attachment(
        owner_type='medical_record',
        owner_id=medical_record_id,
        filename=filename,
        storage_key=storage_key,
        url=url,
        mime_type=mime_type,
        size=size,
        meta_data={type: 'user_uploaded'},
        created_by=current_user_id
      )
    end note
    AttachmentModel -> DB: INSERT INTO attachments\\n(owner_type, owner_id, filename,\\nstorage_key, url, mime_type, size,\\nmeta_data, created_by, created_at)
    activate DB
    note right
      附件關聯:
      - owner_type = 'medical_record'
      - owner_id = medical_record_id
      - 儲存 MinIO 位置資訊
    end note
    DB --> AttachmentModel: attachment_id
    deactivate DB
    AttachmentModel --> MedicalRecordService: Attachment 物件
    deactivate AttachmentModel
  end
end

== 11. 提交事務 ==
MedicalRecordService -> MedicalRecordModel: db.session.commit()
activate MedicalRecordModel
MedicalRecordModel -> DB: COMMIT
activate DB
note right
  提交事務:
  - 醫療記錄已儲存
  - 附件記錄已建立
  - 資料一致性確保
end note
DB --> MedicalRecordModel: 提交成功
deactivate DB
MedicalRecordModel --> MedicalRecordService: 完成
deactivate MedicalRecordModel

MedicalRecordService --> MedicalRecordsBlueprint: MedicalRecord 物件
deactivate MedicalRecordService

MedicalRecordsBlueprint -> MedicalRecordsBlueprint: medical_record.to_dict()
note right
  序列化回應資料:
  - medical_record_id
  - record_type, date, provider
  - details, attachments
  - verified = False
  - created_by, created_at
end note

MedicalRecordsBlueprint --> MedicalRecordsAPI: 201 Created + {message, medical_record}
deactivate MedicalRecordsBlueprint
MedicalRecordsAPI --> MedicalRecordsPage: 醫療記錄創建成功
deactivate MedicalRecordsAPI

== 12. 更新前端顯示 ==
MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsPage: closeAddModal()
MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsPage: 將新記錄加入本地列表
note right
  records.unshift(newMedicalRecord)
  更新本地資料，無需重新載入
end note
MedicalRecordsPage --> User: alert('✅ 醫療記錄創建成功')
deactivate MedicalRecordsPage

User -> MedicalRecordsPage: 確認
activate MedicalRecordsPage
MedicalRecordsPage --> User: 顯示更新後的醫療記錄列表
note right
  新記錄特徵:
  - 顯示未驗證狀態
  - 可預覽附件
  - 可編輯或刪除 (建立者)
end note
deactivate MedicalRecordsPage

== 13. 錯誤處理 ==
opt 創建失敗情境
  alt 動物不存在 (404)
    User -> MedicalRecordsPage: 提交記錄
    activate MedicalRecordsPage
    MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsAPI: createMedicalRecord(...)
    activate MedicalRecordsAPI
    MedicalRecordsAPI --> MedicalRecordsPage: 404 Not Found
    deactivate MedicalRecordsAPI
    MedicalRecordsPage --> User: alert('動物不存在')
    deactivate MedicalRecordsPage
  else 權限不足 (403)
    User -> MedicalRecordsPage: 提交記錄
    activate MedicalRecordsPage
    MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsAPI: createMedicalRecord(...)
    activate MedicalRecordsAPI
    MedicalRecordsAPI --> MedicalRecordsPage: 403 Forbidden
    deactivate MedicalRecordsAPI
    MedicalRecordsPage --> User: alert('無權限為此動物創建醫療紀錄')
    deactivate MedicalRecordsPage
  else 無效的紀錄類型 (400)
    User -> MedicalRecordsPage: 提交記錄
    activate MedicalRecordsPage
    MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsAPI: createMedicalRecord(...)
    activate MedicalRecordsAPI
    MedicalRecordsAPI --> MedicalRecordsPage: 400 Bad Request
    deactivate MedicalRecordsAPI
    MedicalRecordsPage --> User: alert('無效的紀錄類型')
    deactivate MedicalRecordsPage
  else 網路錯誤 (500)
    User -> MedicalRecordsPage: 提交記錄
    activate MedicalRecordsPage
    MedicalRecordsPage -> MedicalRecordsAPI: createMedicalRecord(...)
    activate MedicalRecordsAPI
    MedicalRecordsAPI --> MedicalRecordsPage: 500 Internal Server Error
    deactivate MedicalRecordsAPI
    MedicalRecordsPage --> User: alert('系統錯誤，請稍後再試')
    deactivate MedicalRecordsPage
  end
end

note over User, DB
  **後置條件:**
  1. 醫療記錄已成功儲存至資料庫
  2. 附件已上傳至 MinIO 並建立 Attachment 記錄
  3. 記錄狀態為未驗證 (verified=False)
  4. 前端已更新顯示新建立的記錄
  5. 建立者可編輯或刪除該記錄
  
  **權限規則:**
  **創建權限:**
  - 管理員可為所有動物創建醫療記錄
  - 動物擁有者可為自己的動物創建記錄
  - 收容所會員可為所屬收容所動物創建記錄
  - 其他使用者無權限創建
  
  **編輯權限 (重要限制):**
  - 管理員不能編輯醫療記錄 (只能驗證)
  - 只有建立者可編輯該記錄
  - 管理員的角色是驗證記錄，非修改內容
  
  **資料完整性:**
  - 記錄類型必須為有效的 RecordType enum
  - 日期格式為 YYYY-MM-DD
  - 附件已上傳至 MinIO 並有 storage_key
  - 使用事務確保資料一致性
  
  **附件處理:**
  - 支援圖片 (JPG, PNG, GIF) 和 PDF
  - 每檔最大 5MB
  - 透過預簽名 URL 上傳至 MinIO
  - 建立 Attachment 記錄關聯醫療記錄
  - owner_type='medical_record', owner_id=medical_record_id
  
  **驗證流程:**
  - 新建立的記錄 verified=False
  - 只有管理員可驗證記錄 (使用案例 4.3)
  - 驗證後 verified=True, verified_by=admin_id
  
  **使用情境:**
  - 記錄疫苗接種資訊
  - 記錄健康檢查結果
  - 記錄治療過程
  - 記錄手術資訊
  - 上傳醫療證明文件
  - 建立完整健康檔案
end note

@enduml
